    {
      "source": "Returns the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/Resource.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>Resource</code></a> pointing to a driver configuration file. The configuration file is applied after\napplying <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/System.html#getProperties()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>System Properties</code></a> and the configuration built by this configuration class.",
      "translation": "返回一个指向驱动程序配置文件的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/Resource.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>Resource</code></a>。该配置文件在应用<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/System.html#getProperties()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>System Properties</code></a>以及由本配置类构建的配置之后生效。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Spring <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/Configuration.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>Configuration</code></a> class used to configure a Cassandra client application <code>CqlSession</code> connected to a\nCassandra cluster. Enables a Cassandra Keyspace to be specified along with the ability to execute arbitrary CQL on\nstartup as well as shutdown.",
      "translation": "Spring 使用的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/Configuration.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>Configuration</code></a>类用于配置连接到 Cassandra 集群的 Cassandra 客户端应用程序<code>CqlSession</code>。该功能支持指定 Cassandra Keyspace，并能够在启动和关闭时执行任意的 CQL 语句。",
      "count": 1
    },
