      "source": "<dt>Type Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><span id=\"requireBeanOfType(java.lang.Class)-type-param-T\"><code>T</code> - <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>parameterized class type</code></a> of the bean.</span></dd>\n<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>beanType</code> - <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>type</code></a> of the bean.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>a required bean of the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>type</code></a> from the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>.</dd>\n<dt>See Also:</dt>\n<dd>\n<ul class=\"tag-list\">\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html#getBean(java.lang.Class)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory.getBean(Class)</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#getBeanFactory()\"><code>getBeanFactory()</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>类型参数:</dt>\n<dd><span id=\"requireBeanOfType(java.lang.Class)-type-param-T\"><code>T</code> - 该 Bean 的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>参数化类类型</code></a>。</span></dd>\n<dt>参数:</dt>\n<dd><code>beanType</code> - Bean 的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>类型</code></a>。</dd>\n<dt>返回:</dt>\n<dd>从<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"org.springframework.beans.factory 中的类或接口\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>中获取给定<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>类型</code></a>的必需 Bean。</dd>\n<dt>另请参见:</dt>\n<dd>\n<ul class=\"tag-list\">\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html#getBean(java.lang.Class)\" title=\"org.springframework.beans.factory 中的类或接口\"><code>BeanFactory.getBean(Class)</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#getBeanFactory()\"><code>getBeanFactory()</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>",
      "count": 1
